YASD Smileybyte-Ran-Gno-Neu-Mal at Orcus town

That was the gnomish ranger about whom I posted here asking for
advices (title "Advice on early wand of wish"), when he found a /oWish
at sokoban. Thanks for the advices, but I let the 'early wishes fever'
take on me and I wasted some of them, in the certainty that I would
find another wand at the castle.

So let's see what happened: my gnomish ranger was going well, with my
[CoD and armed with a crossbow and +0/+2 bolts. Went to the mines,
found co-aligned altar, wandered between main dungeon and mines for
some time growing up and searching for better armor. Advanced bow &
crossbow skills, was out of bolts and almost out of arrows when I
decided to go for sokoban to see if I could get some interesting wands
or rings (already had a BoH). For that time I was:

